00:55:42.460 --> 00:55:45.220
tapping into databases--

00:55:45.220 --> 00:55:46.810
or you actually have databases.

00:55:46.810 --> 00:55:48.490
You're not just
operating in a world

00:55:48.490 --> 00:55:50.545
where it's Excel
