00:55:53.170 --> 00:56:00.340
Then showing how you could
stay within the same R notebook

00:56:00.340 --> 00:56:04.210
or framework from
data collection,

00:56:04.210 --> 00:56:07.240
just pulling it straight
into your environment,

00:56:07.240 --> 00:56:10.810
manipulating it
