00:56:18.430 --> 00:56:23.260
or a flexdashboard
or something that's

00:56:23.260 --> 00:56:29.000
still static but interactive,
that has gone a long way too.

00:56:29.000 --> 00:56:30.980
And the speed of
everything, the speed

00:56:30.980 --> 00:56:34.520
of the data manipulation and
data handling for millions

00:56:34.520 --> 00:56:36.890
or tens or hundreds
of millions of rows,

00:56:36.890 --> 00:56:38.510
that always shocks people.

00:56:38.510 --> 00:56:42.410
Because if you've got a lot of
columns in Excel, after about,

00:56:42.410 --> 00:56:46.520
I don't know, 3,000 or 4,000
rows, your Excel is crawling.

00:56:46.520 --> 00:56:49.100
And you can look at your
RAM, and it's eating up

00:56:49.100 --> 00:56:50.570
your entire available RAM.

00:56:50.570 --> 00:56:53.270
Whereas with something
like Python or R,

00:56:53.270 --> 00:56:54.830
it's definitely not the case.

